# What the sdist carries beyond the package (review 2026-11-13, C6).
#
# The sdist builds the package; it does not run the test suite. The suite needs
# the whole checkout (crumb.py, tests/data, fixtures/, evals/, .github/scripts),
# so shipping tests/ alone gave 77 modules that could not run. Test from a clone.
include LICENSE README.md CHANGELOG.md
prune tests
prune fixtures
prune evals
prune docs
